    "利用因式分解简化方程组求解",
    "用Hessian矩阵二阶判别法判断极值类型"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "观察 $f(x,y)=(x^2+y^2)^2+2xy$，求偏导 $f_x,f_y$",
    "解方程组 $f_x=0,f_y=0$，通过相减、相加因式分解求出所有驻点",
    "计算Hessian矩阵在各驻点的值，判断极大/极小/鞍点",
    "计算各极值点处的函数值"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "bivariate_extrema_quartic",
    "template": "f(x,y)=x^4+2x^2y^2+y^4+2xy=(x^2+y^2)^2+2xy",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "所有极值",
      "steps": [
        "求偏导：$f_x=4x^3+4xy^2+2y$，$f_y=4y^3+4x^2y+2x$；令两者为0，即 $2x^3+2xy^2+y=0$ (A)，$2y^3+2x^2y+x=0$ (B)",
        "(A)-(B)：$2(x^3-y^3)-2xy(x-y)+(y-x)=(x-y)[2(x^2+xy+y^2)-2xy-1]=(x-y)(2x^2+2y^2-1)=0$，故 $x=y$ 或 $x^2+y^2=1/2$",
        "情形一 $x=y$：代入(A)得 $4x^3+x=0\\Rightarrow x(4x^2+1)=0\\Rightarrow x=0$（实数解），得驻点 $(0,0)$",
        "情形二 $x^2+y^2=1/2$：(A)+(B)得 $2(x+y)(x^2+y^2)+(x+y)=(x+y)[2\\cdot\\tfrac12+1]=2(x+y)=0\\Rightarrow y=-x$；代入 $x^2+y^2=1/2$ 得 $2x^2=1/2\\Rightarrow x=\\pm\\tfrac12$，得驻点 $(\\tfrac12,-\\tfrac12)$ 和 $(-\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12)$",
        "计算Hessian：$f_{xx}=12x^2+4y^2,\\ f_{yy}=4x^2+12y^2,\\ f_{xy}=8xy+2$。在$(0,0)$：$f_{xx}=f_{yy}=0,f_{xy}=2$，判别式$=0-4=-4<0$，为鞍点",
        "在$(\\tfrac12,-\\tfrac12)$：$f_{xx}=12\\cdot\\tfrac14+4\\cdot\\tfrac14=4,\\ f_{yy}=4\\cdot\\tfrac14+12\\cdot\\tfrac14=4,\\ f_{xy}=8\\cdot(-\\tfrac14)+2=0$，判别式$=16-0=16>0$且$f_{xx}>0$，为极小点；同理$(-\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12)$也是极小点（对称性）",
        "极小值：$f(\\tfrac12,-\\tfrac12)=(\\tfrac14+\\tfrac14)^2+2\\cdot(-\\tfrac14)=\\tfrac14-\\tfrac12=-\\tfrac14$，同理$f(-\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12)=-\\tfrac14$",
        "结论：函数在 $(\\pm\\tfrac12,\\mp\\tfrac12)$ 处取极小值 $-\\tfrac14$；$(0,0)$ 为鞍点，不是极值点；无极大值"
      ]
    }
  ],
