        "对称性化简",
        "Hessian判别"
      ],
      "question_type": "二元函数极值",
      "method": [
        "利用对称性$x=y$简化",
        "Hessian判别法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "求偏导得方程组",
        "利用对称性求解",
        "Hessian判定"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "bivariate_extrema_quartic_simple",
        "template": "u(x,y)=x^4+y^4-4xy",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$u_x=4x^3-4y=0\\Rightarrow y=x^3$；$u_y=4y^3-4x=0\\Rightarrow x=y^3$；代入得 $x=(x^3)^3=x^9\\Rightarrow x^9-x=0\\Rightarrow x(x^8-1)=0$",
            "实数解：$x=0,1,-1$，对应驻点 $(0,0),(1,1),(-1,-1)$",
            "Hessian：$u_{xx}=12x^2,u_{yy}=12y^2,u_{xy}=-4$。在$(0,0)$：判别式$=0-16=-16<0$，鞍点。在$(1,1)$：$u_{xx}=u_{yy}=12$，判别式$=144-16=128>0$，且$u_{xx}>0$，为极小点，值$=1+1-4=-2$。$(-1,-1)$同理也是极小点，值$=1+1-4=-2$"
          ]
        }
      ],
