      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$v_x=4x^3+4xy^2-2y=0$即$2x^3+2xy^2-y=0$(A')；$v_y=4y^3+4x^2y-2x=0$即$2y^3+2x^2y-x=0$(B')",
            "(A')-(B')：$2(x^3-y^3)+2xy(x-y)+(x-y)=(x-y)[2(x^2+xy+y^2)+2xy+1]$，注意此处系数与原题不同，需重新展开：$2x^3+2xy^2-y-2y^3-2x^2y+x=2(x^3-y^3)+2xy(y-x)+(x-y)$，整理为$(x-y)[2(x^2+xy+y^2)-2xy+1]=(x-y)(2x^2+2y^2+1)$。由于 $2x^2+2y^2+1>0$ 恒成立，必有 $x=y$",
            "代入(A')：$2x^3+2x^3-x=0\\Rightarrow4x^3-x=0\\Rightarrow x(4x^2-1)=0\\Rightarrow x=0,\\pm\\tfrac12$，得驻点 $(0,0),(\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12),(-\\tfrac12,-\\tfrac12)$",
            "Hessian：$v_{xx}=12x^2+4y^2,v_{yy}=4x^2+12y^2,v_{xy}=8xy-2$。在$(0,0)$：判别式$=0-4=-4<0$，鞍点。在$(\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12)$：$v_{xx}=v_{yy}=4,v_{xy}=8\\cdot\\tfrac14-2=0$，判别式$=16>0$，$v_{xx}>0$为极小点，值$=(\\tfrac14+\\tfrac14)^2-2\\cdot\\tfrac14=\\tfrac14-\\tfrac12=-\\tfrac14$；$(-\\tfrac12,-\\tfrac12)$同理也是极小点，值$-\\tfrac14$"
